flowchart LR
  accTitle: NutsNews observability layers
  accDescr {
    NutsNews already has Grafana host metrics and logs. Draft application telemetry, managed
    alert email, five public synthetics, and four SLOs still require protected inputs, a
    synthetic cadence decision, apply, and live evidence. Sentry remains the exception store.
  }
  Services["Web, workers, backend and VPS"] --> Grafana["Grafana Cloud\nexisting host metrics and logs"]
  Owners["Backend owns deploy, Alloy and outbox; worker repos own service signals;\ninfra owns Grafana; meta repo coordinates"] --> Services
  Services --> WorkerGate["Every worker ownership state still requires deployed, up,\nfresh scrape, exact identity and readiness series"]
  Live["Live 2026-08-01 19:04 UTC: worker_uplift cutover_active;\nolder candidate 71b030, Runtime 1 PR 471 undeployed"] --> Freeze["Temporary freeze: worker merges and runtime mutations;\nno fetcher v2 migration while cutover_active"]
  Freeze --> Reconcile["Reconcile observation and rollback deadline\nbefore observability rollout"]
  Reconcile --> Services
  Staged["Draft source changes"] --> Pending["Staged application telemetry, email,\nfive synthetics and four SLOs"]
  Pending --> Choice["Cadence unresolved: six minutes,\nfive-minute standing major,\nor reviewed threshold change"]
  Readonly["Read-only audit Environment exists;\nall four inputs still absent"] --> Choice
  Choice --> Apply["Protected apply and post-apply evidence"]
  Apply --> Grafana
  Apply --> Ownership["Ownership dashboard shows backend revision\nand all eight worker identities"]
  Grafana --> Drilldown["Pipeline-run dashboard uses parsed metadata\nand bounded table field links"]
  Drilldown --> Deferred["Hosted-Loki derived fields and Tempo\nremain deferred"]
  Services --> Sentry["Sentry\nscrubbed exceptions and replays"]
  Workflows["Scheduled health and release workflows"] --> Reports["Durable reports and\ndeployment annotations"]
  Providers["Cloudflare, Vercel, Supabase\nand public uptime monitors"] --> Operator["Operator investigation"]
  Grafana --> Operator
  WorkerGate --> Operator
  Ownership --> Operator
  Drilldown --> Operator
  Sentry --> Operator
  Reports --> Operator
